{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassEndomorphism.RhoKGradedExpansion","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassEndomorphism.RhoKGradedExpansion","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Module.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GradedRhoKExpansion.rhoK_LO_when_no_binding","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GradedRhoKExpansion.rhoK_LO_when_no_binding","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/rho-k-graded-expansion.lean#L93-L105","doc":"**The LO piece is the constituent ratio.** When the single-gen\nand higher pieces vanish, ρ_K reduces to the LO ansatz. This\ncaptures the Markov-multiplicativity-derived part. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GradedRhoKExpansion.rhoK","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GradedRhoKExpansion.rhoK","kind":"def","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/rho-k-graded-expansion.lean#L87-L91","doc":"**Definition of ρ_K from the graded expansion.** Dividing\nthrough by `m_e · |tr_M(β_K)|` recovers the categorical density\nfactor (when `|tr_M| ≠ 0`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GradedRhoKExpansion.rhoKGradedExpansion","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GradedRhoKExpansion.rhoKGradedExpansion","kind":"theorem","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/rho-k-graded-expansion.lean#L77-L85","doc":"**The graded ρ_K decomposition** is the named statement of the\nproposition. It is the typeclass field `graded_decomp` lifted\nto a theorem. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GradedRhoKExpansion.graded_decomp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GradedRhoKExpansion.graded_decomp","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/rho-k-graded-expansion.lean#L68-L68","doc":"The graded expansion identity: `M(K) = constituent + single-gen +\nhigher-pieces`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GradedRhoKExpansion.higherPieces","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GradedRhoKExpansion.higherPieces","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/rho-k-graded-expansion.lean#L65-L65","doc":"Higher pieces (pair-gen, Frobenius, chirality, cyclotomic tail).\nIn the current state the proper closed form for these is open;\nthis field aggregates the residual binding correction. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GradedRhoKExpansion.singleGenCorrection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GradedRhoKExpansion.singleGenCorrection","kind":"def","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/rho-k-graded-expansion.lean#L61-L61","doc":"The single-gen log-volume correction `α · Σ ln|V̂_i^full| ∈ ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GradedRhoKExpansion.constituent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GradedRhoKExpansion.constituent","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/rho-k-graded-expansion.lean#L59-L59","doc":"The constituent mass piece `Z m_p + N m_n + Z m_e ∈ ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GradedRhoKExpansion.absTrM","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GradedRhoKExpansion.absTrM","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/rho-k-graded-expansion.lean#L57-L57","doc":"The Markov-trace magnitude `|tr_M(NF_GS(β_K))| ∈ ℝ_{≥0}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GradedRhoKExpansion.atomicMass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GradedRhoKExpansion.atomicMass","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/rho-k-graded-expansion.lean#L55-L55","doc":"The atomic mass functional `M(K) ∈ ℝ` for a braid class. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GradedRhoKExpansion.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GradedRhoKExpansion.mk","kind":"ctor","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/rho-k-graded-expansion.lean#L53-L53","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GradedRhoKExpansion","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GradedRhoKExpansion","kind":"class","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/rho-k-graded-expansion.lean#L49-L71","doc":"Abstract structure for the graded ρ_K expansion. The data\nencodes the constituent (LO) piece, the single-gen log-volume\nsum, and a placeholder for higher pieces (pair-gen + Frobenius +\nchirality + tail). ","signatureChunk":0}]}